 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In the kitchen, Max and some of the cooks are having a quick rest after a long morning when two familiar faces walk in. Senya and Fedya are back, and they have something to say about the people who stayed. We'll hear it in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я очень устал сегодня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Мы много работали утром.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Давайте немного отдохнем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Привет, повара!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Что встали, инвалиды?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Не видите?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Профессионалы пришли.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Вы не профессионалы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Вы просто много говорите.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Мы говорим правду.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Идите работать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Хорошо, мы идем.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Here it is again, piece by piece.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я очень устал сегодня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I'm very tired today.' 'Tired' is a short masculine form, since Max is a man. 'Today' sits at the end.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Мы много работали утром.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We worked a lot this morning.' 'A lot' is a single small word. 'In the morning' has an 'om' ending.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Давайте немного отдохнем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Let's rest a bit.' 'A bit' is literally 'not much'. 'Let's' is made from 'davayte' and a 'we' form.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Привет, повара!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, cooks!' The plural of 'cook' ends in a stressed 'a'. It's an odd plural, but a common one.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Что встали, инвалиды?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why are you standing around, cripples?' Literally, 'what did you get up for'. 'Cripples' is Barinov's pet insult, borrowed by the cooks.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Не видите?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Can't you see?' It is only 'don't you see', with the polite plural. Fedya is mocking.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Профессионалы пришли.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The pros have arrived.' 'Professionals' is a borrowed word, in the plural. 'Arrived' has the plural ending 'li'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Вы не профессионалы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You aren't professionals.' The 'not' goes in front of the noun. There's no 'are'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Вы просто много говорите.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You just talk a lot.' 'Just' and 'a lot' flank the verb. 'Talk' carries 'ite', the polite plural.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Мы говорим правду.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We're telling the truth.' 'We tell' ends in 'im'. 'Truth' takes a 'u' ending.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Идите работать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Go and work!' 'Go' is a polite plural command. The next word is the plain form 'to work'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Хорошо, мы идем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Okay, we're going.' 'We go' finishes with 'yom'. The first word is a quick 'okay'. Here is the whole conversation again.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я очень устал сегодня.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Мы много работали утром.",
   "gap": 0.5
